OL,3,AReform promises to increase tax-free
OL,4,Apersonal allowance to #15,000
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK is promising to increase the
OL,7,Ftax-free personal allowance to #15,000,
OL,8,Fif it wins the next general election.
OL,10,FRobert Jenrick, the party's economic
OL,11,Fspokesman, has pledged to introduce the
OL,12,Ftax cut within the first 100 days if he
OL,13,Fbecame chancellor saying it would
OL,14,Fprovide "money that people really need
OL,15,Fright now".
OL,17,FIt is seen by Reform insiders as the
OL,18,Fflagship policy announcement of its
OL,19,Fconference and perhaps their biggest
OL,20,Ftax policy between now and the general
OL,21,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
